{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a church at the end of your street- but there shouldn't be.\u00a0You saw it when walking home from the bus stop after work. You grew up on this street. You have walked down this road daily. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is not a church at the end of the street.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this text-based horror game, you play as someone haunted by a church. It infects your day, and will do anything to get you to come inside. Will you be able to resist it? Or will the church swallow you whole?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand Drawn Art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Church\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching Narrative -\u00a0 Your choices change how you interact with the church</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings - Some good, some bad, some ????</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bad Ending - Digested","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3789180/5c35b59707e960ccf3fd4ecc0fb0eccadd606521.jpg"},{"name":"Bad Ending - Crushed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3789180/63f7475c9535349a89326b028ca0de74c5636b57.jpg"},{"name":"Bad Ending - Sleeping Forever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3789180/eec25d73b758f6ac11ebd364c87d6c3e88205baf.jpg"},{"name":"Bad Ending - Why Shouldn't I stay?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3789180/eec25d73b758f6ac11ebd364c87d6c3e88205baf.jpg"},{"name":"Bad Ending - Finding Solace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3789180/9e64d809696dfdc1a585ff1a6910b270ae6054cc.jpg